# Line endings: normalized to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Windows tooling rewrites tracked files with CRLF, which makes "the frozen
# snapshot is untouched" impossible to assert by hash. This is a policy
# declaration, made before the first commit so no renormalization is needed.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never examined for line endings, never normalized.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db   binary
*.sqlite binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
